<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Home - Oficina</title>

    <style>
        body{
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background:#f4f4f4;
            margin:0;
            padding:0;
        }

        header{
            background:#0d6efd;
            color:white;
            padding:20px;
            text-align:center;
        }

        main{
            width:80%;
            margin:40px auto;
            text-align:center;
        }

        .menu{
            display:flex;
            justify-content:center;
            gap:20px;
            margin-top:40px;
            flex-wrap:wrap;
        }

        .card{
            width:220px;
            background:white;
            padding:20px;
            border-radius:10px;
            box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
        }

        .card a{
            display:inline-block;
            margin-top:15px;
            text-decoration:none;
            background:#0d6efd;
            color:white;
            padding:10px 20px;
            border-radius:5px;
        }

        .card a:hover{
            background:#084298;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>Sistema da Oficina</h1>
    <p>Bem-vindo ao sistema de gerenciamento.</p>
</header>

<main>

    <h2>Menu Principal</h2>

    <div class="menu">

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Clientes</h3>
            <p>Cadastre, edite e consulte clientes.</p>
            <a href="/clientes">Acessar</a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Veículos</h3>
            <p>Gerencie os veículos cadastrados.</p>
            <a href="/veiculos">Acessar</a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Ordens</h3>
            <p>Controle as ordens de serviço.</p>
            <a href="/ordens">Acessar</a>
        </div>

    </div>

</main>

</body>
</html>
